# spec: GET [1.14] is the Bose app's "Remember my last setting": 00 reads as off.
# source: hardware report on firmware 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590: switching "Remember my last setting" off in the Bose app changed [1.14] from 01 to 00 and nothing else.
device nc700
call cnc_persist
send 01 0e 01 00
recv 01 0e 03 01 00
result ok off
